<description>&lt;p&gt;A major earthquake in Colombia has killed more than 224 people and rescue operations are ongoing. Russian forces struck a major deployment hub in Ukraine that was used by Colombian mercenaries, targeting them directly. The United Nations urged De la Espriella to uphold Colombia’s peace agreement. A U.S. indictment has revived former FARC leader Timochenko’s name in a Venezuelan case involving Maduro. The conflict still produced 225 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOZG9JcGwxa3JURV92YlA4U21DR1hEYnNCNUg3bGsxdFh0alhCd29MZHMxTXJ6OUtRZTRjYnk1V2txWDQ3ZU5lQnhpLUpOSE50aVNrOV9lakZ6em5STnYtMC14RDVpN1B6bGlHZEx2VGs5N0JqZ09OUkUybzBTT2lzYU85bTlsZkM4b3ZQbkJvNmlCLXlaLTZVaFI5cWE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Watch Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9GVXBpRkZTcEVLcHhYaC14YU9FRGtMN25QYm53YzVmZUZ3d0JaTll4ZXdueUhZMzhKNlNucjVTbGhCYVhQT2Z2UFZ3azhZOTBoRHctYnNZdmw0eGZYZHJ3TlVfTko?oc=5&quot;&gt;IMDb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPallYSERaZlNHZ0NLczNmS0lHQ2Uyb1Q0NEg2VEhPaTR4c3RoaWk5WGVHa3M4QUt3RTdFMzFyVlh2TTJ6LXlsNXJvLV9YWjRMTnMySGE3UlpZUGxiYWNpbEVHbTdlQUVDc1dHMmNWZ1pOclVpV3hmYmlQOXNDOG5tTFVCZDdGUS1tTllmTS1hVXpDRV84NzZya29WYmJVbExwakJQM2dldlZpc3IzS1JMQUtWS3Z2dER4U3hLY0N30gG-AUFVX3lxTE9qWVhIRFpmU0dnQ0tzM2ZLSUdDZTJvVDQ0SDZUSE9pNHhzdGhpaTlYZUdrczhBS3dFN0UzMXJWWHZNMnoteWw1cm8tX1haNExOczJIYTdSWllQbGJhY2lsRUdtN2VBRUNzV0cyY1ZnWk5yVWlXeGZiaVA5c0M4bm1MVUJkN0ZRLW1OWWZNLWFVekNFXzg3NnJrb1ZiYlVsTHBqQlAzZ2V2VmlzcjNLUkxBS1ZLdnZ0RHhTeEtjQ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, 